#1201
The Mud Dumping Ground~

  This room is used by the mud code as a dumping ground for buggy
objects or mobs. The old code used to simply invoke the assert call
which causes a silent failure and reboot. That is the chickeshit
method for handling problems. If an object show up here the mud will
log the error and you can bet there is SOMEthing wrong with the obj,
mob, or container that the obj was supposed to be in.

~
