#1215
Diamond's Lair~
     A very basic room is layed out before you.  A wooden table
rest in the far corner with 2 old chairs.  On top of the table
are a few sharpening stones and a small vial of oil.
     Everything else is rather plain.  Wait, you notice some
scratches on the north wall.  As you examine them with more 
detail you find that there are literally hundreds of names.  
The thing that catches your eye is that there is a line through
ALL of them.  Some of the names you recognize, actually a few USE
to be your close friends, while others do not ring a bell.
At the bottom of the list there are a few names that have no
marks through them.   One is YOURS!
~
