#1233
&01The UnderWorld&00~
You awake, visions of your death still vivid in your mind. The pain..
the blood..then darkness. You clamber to your feet, feeling a strange
power flow through your limbs. An immense stone chamber sprawls about 
you, filling you with dread and fear. Possessed by some dark force, 
you walk for what seems like an eternity. You slowly approach a mass of
bones and realize it is a massive throne, made of skulls. Seated upon
it is an ominous figure, staring down at you with interest. You fall to
your knees as you realize where you are...and what you have become.
~
