#1242
Kaidon's Rift In Time~
You find yourself standing amidst everything, and nothing.  Images fade
and reform around you, shifting the landscape through a myriad of scenes.
At the moment, you stand in a small cabin, the sounds of a thunderstorm
echoing from outside.  Wind creeps in through the window to threaten a
tall candle sitting on a table.  As your gaze rests on the flickering
flame, you begin to feel much smaller as the light expands to become a
blinding sun.  From beneath your feet, a comet archs in its approach
toward the star, which suddenly contracts to form an eye, surrounded by
the sleek black feathers of a raven.
~
