#1250
De - The Immortal Guild Hall - Kn~
A long hallway stretches to the north, lined with small alcoves along either
side, including ones to your immediate east and west.  Each of these spaces
appears to have a board in it.  All along the hall, you see artistic
renderings on the walls depicting the various classes of RavenMUD.  Before
you on the west wall, you see the ominous figure of a Death Knight, eyes
glowing with an eery red light as if burning from within.  He almost appears
to be glaring across the hallway.  Looking to your east, you see the figure
of a Solamnic Knight, looking grimly determined as he prepares for battle.
You happen to notice that someone has tied the laces of his boots together.
