#1270
The Map Room~
This room was created to provide "maps" of the lands I 
consider west of samsera to imms only and for imm use only.  
I hope that my request that these not be shared with ANY 
non-imm be honored.  These maps are provided to the gods only.  
The maker of these maps does this for the fact that many gods 
don't have time to "mud" as mortals and exlpore the realms, 
and that being so, sometimes imms(who are mortals too) don't 
know the worlds which they govern.  I merely wish to provide 
an aid.  I make these maps formyself.  I do NOT share them all.  
Over the years, i've shared less than a dozen with the same 
number of people merely to try to urge them to explore and make 
such maps for themselves.  The ones I do share are very simply 
laid out zones, like gnolls of the black fang.
Each zone's map is an ascii node map.  where lines 
designate paths, instersections of lines designate "rooms".  
Too see a zone's map, use "look <zonename>"  such as "look haon-dor".
~
12 d 0 0 0 0
D1
~
~
