#1280
&03Temple of the Apprentice&00~
You stand inside a small, humbly constructed Temple which bustles with
people. Rows of hard benches are occupied by young adventurers seeking
tutelage from the Temple priests before they venture out into the realm
of Raven. Some appear confident and prepared, others uncertain and
nervous. You begin to walk towards the temple door, wondering if you are
indeed ready for the challenges and adventures which await you.
If the challenges are too much...  If you think you are not ready...?
Venture upward to the &02Midgaard University&00.  Education can be deadly!
~
