#1281
&13Temple of the Journeyman&00~
   Large stone steps lead down into the Center of Samsera from this
large elevated plateau. The Temple is made of a cracked white marble,
adding to the feeling of purity and peace you always experience here.
Large columns reach to the sky, surrounded by many benches and tables.
